  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed in news and formal writing to describe situations that are becoming more severe. Typically appears as {激化|げきか}する (to intensify) or {激化|げきか}している (is intensifying).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {競争|きょうそう}が{激化|げきか}する: competition intensifies\n- {紛争|ふんそう}が{激化|げきか}する: a conflict escalates\n- {対立|たいりつ}が{激化|げきか}する: opposition intensifies\n- {激化|げきか}の{一途|いっと}をたどる: to continue to escalate",
